&lt;H3 style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;SITUATION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/H3&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Following the nuclear exchange at sea, the world teeters on the brink of a catastrophic nuclear conflict. Soviet forces are advancing with strength through the "Fuda Gap," overwhelming NATO group forces as they push forward. Thus far, nuclear weapons have not been deployed on land.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;In Norway, NATO forces have consolidated for a defensive last stand near Trondheim, awaiting reinforcements including two amphibious groups supported by robust land-based air assets from the UK.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;

