&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Location: Nova Scotia - North Atlantic&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Duration: 1 Day 12 Hrs&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Playable Sides: NATO&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;H3 style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;SITUATION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/H3&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Soviet submarines have initiated a bold push through the GIUK Gap, threatening one of NATO’s most critical naval chokepoints and its bustling shipping lanes. In a rapid response, NATO is marshaling Anti-Submarine Warfare (ASW) assets from every available nation to counter this looming menace.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Amid this tense standoff, Canada has swiftly assembled an ASW Task Group centered around HMCS Bonaventure, along with her vigilant escorts and support ship. Currently stationed in Halifax, this formidable group stands ready, awaiting the command to launch into the Atlantic and commence ASW operations against the shadowy underwater threat.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR class=Apple-interchange-newline&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;

&lt;BODY&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB'&gt;&lt;B id=docs-internal-guid-76782a23-7fff-cb37-031b-ff0c81a34023 style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;
