&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Location: Aleutian Islands - North Pacific&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Duration: 18 Hours&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Playable Sides: NATO&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;BR&gt;
&lt;H3 style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-TOP: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;SITUATION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/H3&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;As global tensions escalate daily, US Forces have accelerated their efforts to fortify Shemya AFB in the strategically critical Aleutian Island Chain. Reinforcements, including a US Marine Company equipped with AMTRACs and a Hawk SAM Battery, have been deployed and are now battle-ready.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Unconfirmed reports indicate a significant buildup of aircraft at Klyuchi Air Base, suggesting the Soviets could soon have the capability to target the vital radar chain in the Aleutian Islands. The sense of impending conflict is palpable as both sides prepare for possible engagements.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR class=Apple-interchange-newline&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;

