&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Location: North Atlantic&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Duration: 1 Day&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Playable Sides: Soviet Union&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;This scenario is played from the Soviet point of view in Europe.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;SITUATION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;A few days ago, Soviet forces launched a devastating attack on the radar sites in the Aleutian Islands, crippling the radar chain. With these sites inoperable, the US Western Seaboard, Alaska, and Canada are left vulnerable to attacks. In a desperate scramble, US and Canadian forces are rigging temporary Gap Filler Radar Sites to restore some semblance of detection capability.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Simultaneously, fears are mounting in Europe that Soviet forces might replicate this strike across Northern Europe and the UK. The atmosphere is charged with anxiety and anticipation as NATO braces for the next move.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR class=Apple-interchange-newline&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;

