&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Location: Azores - Mid Atlantic&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Duration: 1 Day 18 Hours&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Playable Sides: NATO&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;SITUATION&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Since the outbreak of hostilities, civilian ships have increasingly come under attack, resulting in tragic civilian casualties and jeopardizing vital supply and trade routes. In response, protective measures have been implemented to safeguard the many merchant vessels constantly at risk.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;In the Mid-Atlantic, a formidable French naval group, bolstered by a US cruiser and its escorts, is en route to South America. They have amassed a convoy of threatened merchant ships and are now escorting them to the safety of Ponta Delgada in the Azores. Nearby Portuguese warships have also joined the convoy, providing additional escort and protection.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.38" dir=ltr&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: Arial,sans-serif; FONT-VARIANT: normal; VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent"&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Throughout this escalating conflict, the Red Banner Fleet has deployed warships and submarines worldwide. Their aggression has intensified, with frequent interceptions of merchant ships. Immediate action is imperative to maintain the vital naval supply lines.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR class=Apple-interchange-newline&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;

