&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This tutorial is designed to help you understand the concept of air to air refueling in Command. After running this tutorial you should have a better idea of how to set up different kinds of tanker missions, and how to effectively manipulate Refuel doctrine to get optimum results.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;In this tutorial you will:&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;UL&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Refuel a number of fighters operating in a training area&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Accompany fighters on a ferry mission and refuel them halfway&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;See both manual and auto refueling in action&lt;/LI&gt;
&lt;LI&gt;Find out how to have a tanker refuel another tanker&lt;/LI&gt;
